[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3211913517","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109817#issuecomment-3211913517","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109817","id":3211913517,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_cekt","user":{"login":"pcb060","id":28874428,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4ODc0NDI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28874428?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcb060","html_url":"https://github.com/pcb060","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcb060/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcb060/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcb060/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcb060/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcb060/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcb060/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcb060/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcb060/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pcb060/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-21T20:00:53Z","updated_at":"2025-08-21T20:56:39Z","body":"Having the same issue on X11, Godot v4.4.1 (via Steam).\nClosing and reopening the editor will let me rename a single node successfully, after this any attempt fails as described above. \n\n**System info:**\nGodot v4.4.1.stable - Steam Runtime 2 (soldier) 2 on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Mobile) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 6600 XT (RADV NAVI23) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-12400F (12 threads)\n\n**edit:**\n\n> It would appear that moving the mouse cursor over and out of the edited item is what triggers the issue.\n\nActually, I can reproduce this:\n\n1. Open project\n2. Select any node\n3. Enter rename mode via F2\n4. Insert new name\n5. Press Enter -> successful\n7. Repeat step 2-5 -> step 5 fails, nothing happens\n8. Press Esc\n9. Repeat step 2-4\n10. While still in \"rename mode\", move cursor to other monitor\n11. Move cursor back to \"Godot monitor\"\n12. Refocus the name field by clicking on the text field\n13. Press Enter -> successful","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3211913517/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3214753914","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109817#issuecomment-3214753914","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109817","id":3214753914,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_nUB6","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-22T15:19:33Z","updated_at":"2025-08-22T15:19:33Z","body":"Hi, I have a theory for what's going on.\n\nI did some tracing and it looks like `Popup`s, one of which is reused for the edit field, track a certain `hide_reason`, which gets stuck to \"canceled\" (esc pressed) when this bug happens. It's supposed to be cleared by \"keyboard (un)focus\" window events but they don't get sent to popups on Wayland. I have absolutely no idea what's going on with X11 but I wouldn't be surprised if it were the same thing.\n\nI'll try implementing a fix soon for the Wayland backend and if it works I'll make a PR.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3214753914/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3217947457","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109817#issuecomment-3217947457","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109817","id":3217947457,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_zftB","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-24T08:47:25Z","updated_at":"2025-08-24T08:47:25Z","body":"Updated the issue title as, per the above report by @pcb060, both display drivers seem to be affected.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3217947457/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3218000852","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109817#issuecomment-3218000852","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109817","id":3218000852,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_zsvU","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-24T10:25:12Z","updated_at":"2025-08-24T10:25:12Z","body":"Hi, #109927 is up. Can you both confirm that it solves your issue? It should be platform-agnostic.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3218000852/reactions","t