//api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109817","id":3228729164,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Acn9M","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-27T15:42:22Z","updated_at":"2025-08-27T15:42:22Z","body":"This issue reminds me of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/97211 which was fixed by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/97447 in 4.4.\n\nI'd be curious if folks are able to reproduce the issue in 4.4.1? The original report is a little unclear - it says \"Not reproducible in 4.4.1 to my knowledge\" but I don't know if they tested it or were just working from memory?\n\nPersonally, I've been trying to reproduce on X11 (with `master` on b267c2fc6), and haven't been able to so far. Can folks who can reproduce the issue share which X11 WM or Wayland compositor you are using?\n\nI was able to reproduce https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/97211 with i3 after configuring an IME, but there were previous similar-ish issues that I wasn't able to reproduce until I tried the same WM as the reporter. My usual WM is i3 (v4.23), which I know isn't the most common, so I can also just try some more common ones when I get a chance","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3228729164/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3228780637","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109817#issuecomment-3228780637","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109817","id":3228780637,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Ac0hd","user":{"login":"Cykyrios","id":53737317,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNzM3MzE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53737317?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios","html_url":"https://github.com/Cykyrios","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-27T15:55:02Z","updated_at":"2025-08-27T15:55:02Z","body":"I probably should've phrased that differently - I don't remember having encountered this issue in 4.4, but clearly some people have; and it has been happening \"often\" on the master branch during the 4.5 dev cycle.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3228780637/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3228928925","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109817#issuecomment-3228928925","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109817","id":3228928925,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7AdYud","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-27T16:33:27Z","updated_at":"2025-08-27T16:36:50Z","body":"FTR I can replicate this on sway, running commit 7cc3f374a53b9b10357a6ccb7f5634075f950890 with the Wayland backend on, by simply pressing ESC and trying to edit again:\n\n1. Press enter on a node in the tree, the rename popup appears\n2. Write stuff, rename, the thing works multiple times\n3. Press enter again but this time exit the popup with ESC\n4. From now on renaming is broken.\n\nThat said, with the following steps I can't replicate the issue on X11. There is supposedly logic to trigger a focus but since @pcb060 could replicate it perhaps there's an edge case, especially since they can easily revert out of it. I can't replicate the issue there not even with their steps, although I'm currently testing on my laptop with a single monitor and I'm running the whole thing over XWayland.\n\n@dsnopek regarding the previous bugs, I'm not sure if they're strictly related. Like, they are too focus dependent but I think that there's this weird implicit reliance on the \"focused\" state for popups which, according to the docs, should not even happen in the first place.\n\nFor the Wayland backend we could emulate focus for popups (there's also a feature for grabbing focus but I always found it difficult to work with) but IMO we should not rely on the focus state for popups in the client-side code in the first place and just assume that FLAG_POPUP windows are \"implicitly\" focused, like the docs imply.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3228928925/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3229036153","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109817#issuecomment-3229036153","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109817","id":3229036153,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Ady55","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-27T17:08:00Z","updated_at":"2025-08-27T17:08:00Z","body":"I just tried using GNOME (mutter 42.9) on Wayland, and when using the Godot wayland display driver, I am able to reproduce the issue! (It doesn't happen for me in the same environment when using xwayland with Godot's X11 display driver.)\n\nI can confirm that https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109927 fixes the issue for me","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3229036153/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]